WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.760
How many steps does SCP-087 actually have?

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.680
It’s actually quite simple, really. There&nbsp;
are thirteen steps on each platform,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:13.200
and there are...A lot of platforms. Based on&nbsp;
math so complex we couldn’t possibly explain,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:17.920
we have come to the conclusion that&nbsp;
there are 91,482 steps in total.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:24.560
If you disagree, you’re free to step into SCP-087,&nbsp;
head towards the bottom, and double-check for us…

